<div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Translations!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;The&nbsp;fact&nbsp;that&nbsp;people&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;translate&nbsp;my&nbsp;stuff&nbsp;feels&nbsp;like&nbsp;even&nbsp;a&nbsp;larger&nbsp;fever&nbsp;dream</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-watchman">The Watchman</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-overseer">The Overseer</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:lolfoundation">The lolFoundation Theme</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.net.pl/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></strong> - on the Polish Wiki Branch</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;What's&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;small&nbsp;images&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;page?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;What's&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;small&nbsp;images&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;page?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>These are <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-achievement-badges">SCP Achievement Badges</a>, a cool little system made for fun by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605967619" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" >Roget</a></span>. Yes, I know that technically I don't count for the &quot;International Skip Of Mystery&quot; mystery achievement, but English isn't my main language so that sorta counts. For the explanation about the &quot;Certificate Of Attendance&quot;, which requires for me to add to a Collaborative Log, I was the one who created the two reimaginings of two of the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/roget-s-proposal">Roget</a> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/roget-s-conspiracy-theory-for-scp-001">Proposals</a> in the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/abridged-retirement-proposals">Abridged Retirement Proposals</a> during its drafting phase, so that also technically counts.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <blockquote> <p>&quot;im gonna separate you from your family&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1802367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605967619" alt="stephlynch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1802367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" >stephlynch</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;𝔩𝐎ØⓀ 𝓲ή Δ м𝕚𝐑Ｒ𝓸г&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605967619" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:ur