&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The following is a posting found torn from the Board in &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/larue-hub&quot;&gt;La Rue Macabre.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
