&lt;p&gt;look. it aint bad. have a taste. i made some more. its real good. ill feed it to you with my own hands. thats good eatin and good service. where else are you gonna find that? grossery stores? restorants? the fuckin food coop?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;its clean. its tasty. pleas im begging yall come out and have some. im not useless. im doin the best i can. i dont have lots in my head right now but i have plenty of sweat and tears to cry for you.&lt;/p&gt;
