is classified as SCP-5458-1.</p> <p>SCP-5458-1 can be produced infinitely by SCP-5458; it is currently impossible to find the cause of the production, and it is impossible to stop the production permanently.</p> <p>According to the results of experiments tested on D-Class subjects by Doctor ██████, when exposing a human to SCP-5458-1 without any protective clothing, the subject will die within 2 - 5 minutes due to blood loss if not treated properly and 10 - 25 seconds if inhaled, making the gas very dangerous to humans. It is also tested that when SCP-5458-1 is released, it will significantly increase the surrounding environment's temperature. This can be used to detect SCP-5458-1's presence.</p> <p>SCP-5458-1 cannot be destroyed but can be neutralized into SCP-5458-2 when reacted with hydrogen chloride. SCP-5458-2 is not corrosive, nor does it have any adverse effects on humans. SCP-5458-2 is usually ventilated out of the building after the SCP-5458-1 neutralization procedure is complete. Interestingly, SCP-5458-2 is weighed to be 1.29 times lighter than hydrogen gas, which is an anomaly thought to be scientifically impossible.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5458-1 Neutralization Procedures:</strong></p> <p>Bleach will first be applied onto SCP-5458 to protect the entity from any corrosion of the chemicals. 108L of hydrogen chloride will then be released into the cell. It will take approximately 5 minutes for the hydrogen chloride to neutralize all present SCP-5458-1. Extra hydrogen chloride is then to be released, and the cell is to be left for five additional minutes before ventilating all SCP-5458-2 and remaining hydrogen chloride out of the building. Fresh air will then be released back into the cell.</p> <p><strong>Discovery and Investigation:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5458 was first located in an abandoned house in ████ ██████, Israel. It was found in a basement with four human remains and an old man performing on the entity. SCP-5458 was seized during an MTF Beta-7 (&quot;Maz Hatters&quot;) raid when three residents and a local policeman were reported missing after exploring the house. An MTF agent (B7-3) and the old man were both killed due to contact with SCP-5458-1.<br /> After a thorough investigation of the house, traces of a cult named &quot;Isaiah Lebar&quot; were found. Ethnicity DNA tests from bloodstains also lead to an Israeli village called Quaal. MTF agents searched Quaal for the cult. However, no traces were found except a book titled «Testaments of Isaiah Lebar».</p> <p><strong>Addendum:</strong></p> <p>Below is a section of the transmission log between Doctor ██████ and three MTF Beta-7 team members (B7-1, B7-2, and B7-3). This was recorded when the anomaly was identified in the house and when B7-3 and the old man were killed.</p> <blockquote> <p>Exploration Transmission Log Transcript<br /> Date: ██/██/████<br /> Exploration Team: MTF Beta-7 (&quot;Haz Matters&quot;)<br /> Subject: SCP-5458<br /> Team Members: B7-1, B7-2, B7-3</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> B7 team, do you copy?<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> Copy, sir.<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Copy.<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> I copy.<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Oh, it’s starting to smell really bad down there.<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> Gosh, it’s&#8230; bad.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Keep going, don’t stop.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Do you guys hear anything?<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> Not really… Wait, no, I hear some sort of music.<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> I think it is a piano.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> That’s right, go in, go in the room quickly, put on your masks.<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> We have it on, we are entering the room now.<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> We are in, it appears that someone is playing on a piano&#8230;<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> The room is stained with rotten blood, there are corpses everywhere what the hell!<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> You guys are on track, seize this &quot;someone&quot; and the piano<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Yes sir.<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> Get onto the floor now!<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> He seems to be an old man.<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Do not move, stay on the floor. You [INAUDIBLE] are gunna get your self killed.<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> He’s being handcuffed.<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> [INAUDIBLE].<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> There are many corpses around here, from the texture, I think it has been rotting for a while&#8230;<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Good job, you guys need backup?<br /> <br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> Room is clear, we need backup to carry the piano.<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> It’s getting very hard to breath.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Sending more agents in. You guys will have to wait for three minutes. Do you copy?<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Copy.<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> I copy, sir.<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> Aw fuck! It hurts! Shit. Ouch. I’m gunna start bleeding!<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Evade the room. Dash three do you copy? What is happening?<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Call for medical backup, dash three is bleeding uncontrollably, we are unsure why.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Help is on the way, where exactly are you bleeding? Do you have your<br /> ma-<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> NO DAMNIT I DON’T, FUCK, SHIT IT HURTS LIKE HELL! PLEASE&#8230; HELP ME.<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> dash three didn’t have his mask on, I think it is [INAUDIBLE] some form of gas. We are evading him out of the room currently, shit, his head looks like a tomato. Blood is everywhere.<br /> <strong>B7-3:</strong> [INAUDIBLE], I am gunna die!<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Dash three, do you copy? Dash three?<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> He’s unconscious, sir.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Evade the room immediately.<br /> <strong>B7-1</strong>: Shit, I think he is dead.<br /> <strong>B7-2</strong>: The old man is also bleeding, it is screaming sir.<br /> <strong>Doctor ██████:</strong> Forget about the old man, do NOT take off your masks, get the hell out and close the damn door. Do you copy?<br /> <strong>B7-2:</strong> Yes sir.<br /> <strong>B7-1:</strong> Copy.</p> </blockquote> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5457">SCP-5457</a> | SCP-5458 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5459">SCP-5459</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/friskaunderscore" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7006299&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605967623" alt="FriskaUnderscore" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7006299)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/friskaunderscore" >FriskaUnderscore</a></span></p> 
