&lt;p&gt;In the event that I have disappeared off of the wiki and IRC for a period longer than 6 months without any notice or updates, I entrust the curation of all my solo &lt;em&gt;La Rue Macabre&lt;/em&gt; content to &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187161&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605967624&quot; alt=&quot;plaidypus&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187161)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus&quot;  &gt;plaidypus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, all my other solo stuff to &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605967624&quot; alt=&quot;DrAkimoto&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto&quot;  &gt;DrAkimoto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and my collaborative articles with their respective co-authors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These curators are expressly allowed to make substantive modifications to my work, provided it doesn&#039;t change the overall theme of the piece. (An Alagaddan skip will remain Alaggadan, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
