msg-time">Today at 8:50 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">Oh no, I'm not trusting anything deep web related. Miss me with that.</div> </div> </div> <div class="message johnny"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:51 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">i just need something<br /> like homework solutions and answer keys and stuff like that<br /> work smart not hard, as my dad says</div> </div> </div> <div class="message brick"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">brick</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:51 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">brick assures u u're going to work smart and not hard</div> </div> </div> <div class="message johnny"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:51 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">give me the loot</div> </div> </div> <div class="message brick attch1"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">brick</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:52 PM</div> </div> <div class="attachment"> <div class="icon-code"></div> <div class="attachmentInner"> <div class="filenameLinkWrapper"><a class="anchor" href="https://example.com/" target="_blank">bricklizt.zip</a><br /> <div class="metadata">1&#160;MB</div> </div> </div> <br /> <a class="anchor" href="https://example.com/" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/component:discord-chat-source/download-arrow.svg" alt="download-arrow.svg" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div class="message johnny"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:52 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">what is this</div> </div> </div> <div class="message astro"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">astro929923</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:53 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">&#8230;Aren't these illegal?</div> </div> </div> <div class="message brick"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">brick</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:54 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">No <span class="at_mention">@astro929923</span><br /> Here is list of link brick give you <span class="at_mention">@jDIZZLE</span><br /> ther ealso discord ID of person brick's Friend recommended<br /> You can ask any question and they give any answer, trust brick<br /> that is all I can provide<br /> We gamer now?</div> </div> </div> <div class="message johnny"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:55 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">i suppose</div> </div> </div> <div class="message astro"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">astro929923</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:55 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">Yeah&#8230;</div> </div> </div> <div class="message brick"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">brick</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 8:56 PM</div> </div> <div class="content"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/winners-don-t-do-drugs/catdanse.jpg" class="msgimage" alt="catdanse.jpg" /><br /> Its gamer time <span class="at_mention">@everyone</span><br /> get in voice</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/winners-don-t-do-drugs/clethosdms.png" alt="clethosdms.png" class="image" /></div> <p>Johnny's chin was propped against his knuckles, his elbows on the table. His eyes were glued to the monitor as he stared at the mysterious user’s profile picture.</p> <p>Brick’s zip file was full of broken and incredibly suspicious links, but finally Johnny found himself at the user’s profile. This was his last shot, and he couldn’t afford not to take it.</p> <p>Be it math questions, history questions, life advice, or even financial advice, Clethos apparently could answer it all. However, Johnny didn’t feel comfortable trusting someone so enigmatic so soon, let alone someone from the darker circles of the internet.</p> <p>It was worth a shot though. After all, any help was better than no help at all.</p> <p>After pondering his next move for a moment, Johnny placed his hands on his keyboard, then began to type.</p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="message johnnydm"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 11:29 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">hey so uh, i was referred to you by a friend of mine named brick, i was told you could help me out as like a tutor of sorts?<br /> i mostly need help with math<br /> and history<br /> and physics<br /> idk<br /> can you help me? please?</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>A “<strong>CLETHOS is typing…</strong>” blinked beneath the input box as Johnny waited. Sixty dreadful seconds had passed, and knowing how apparently tech-savvy this Clethos person was, they were probably typing up something very long.</p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="message clethos"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">CLETHOS</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 11:30 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">I only take <em>serious</em> inquiries<br /> Sorry.</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>He was wrong. Shut down not by an essay, but only six words.</p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="message johnnydm"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 11:30 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">ok<br /> srry to bother you then</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>Johnny sighed out of frustration and started pacing around his room. His mind raced with numerous alternative scenarios for what to do. He dug his fingers deep into his black hair. He came up with nothing: he had no other options.</p> <p><em>What the fuck do I do now?</em> He huffed loudly, thrusting his hands to his sides in anger. All that deep-diving and web crawling, searching for answers and solutions, clicking on suspicious links and chatting with unsavory people&#8230; was it all for nothing? Was he <em>really</em> going to just flunk out all because of this?</p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="divider"><span class="dividerContent">New Messages</span></div> <div class="message clethos"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">CLETHOS</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 11:32 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">Actually, I might be able to help you.</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>Johnny rushed back to his computer after hearing a ping, plopping down in his seat as he focused in on the “<strong>CLETHOS is typing…</strong>” at the bottom of the screen.</p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="message johnnydm"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">jDIZZLE</div> <div class="msg-time">Today at 11:32 PM</div> </div> <div class="content">oh shit, really?<br /> thats epic! ho